{"scene_id": "s01899", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s01899.fountain", "heading": "INT. DISUSED SWIMMING POOL, DRAINED - DAWN", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "TEDDY", "names": ["TEDDY"], "gender": "?", "first": 4, "spoke": 11}, {"id": 1, "name": "WRZESIEN", "names": ["WRZESIEN"], "gender": "?", "first": 4, "spoke": 0}, {"id": 2, "name": "MERCEDES ARRIAGA-KOWAL", "names": ["MERCEDES ARRIAGA-KOWAL", "MERCEDES"], "gender": "f", "first": 5, "spoke": 9}, {"id": 3, "name": "DEZ", "names": ["DEZ"], "gender": "m", "first": 20, "spoke": 9}, {"id": 4, "name": "ADEWALE-FRIEDMAN", "names": ["ADEWALE-FRIEDMAN"], "gender": "?", "first": 20, "spoke": 0}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. DISUSED SWIMMING POOL, DRAINED - DAWN", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "A concrete bowl, cracked and stained, ringed with faded lane markers.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Pigeons nest in the diving platform.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Light slants through a skylight clouded with grime.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "TEODORA \"TEDDY\" WRZESIEN (17, wiry, a swimmer's shoulders, a hoodie that says CITY NATATORIUM) stands at the deep end in bare feet, a jump rope coiled around her wrist.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "Across the pool, her coach MERCEDES ARRIAGA-KOWAL (50s, whistle, a face carved from patience) sits on a folding chair at the shallow end, a stopwatch resting on her knee.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Come on, Teddy. Twenty more.", "name": "MERCEDES", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's drained, Coach. There's no water.", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "There's no water, and you still have to move.", "name": "MERCEDES", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Why?", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Because the meet is Saturday and you don't have a pool.", "name": "MERCEDES", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "Teddy loops the rope over her head and begins to skip, the soles slapping the bare concrete.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "Each landing echoes.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "The pigeons shift.", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Knees, Teddy. Higher.", "name": "MERCEDES", "speaker": 2, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "They're at my chin.", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then your chin goes higher.", "name": "MERCEDES", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "Teddy laughs, losing the rhythm.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "The rope snags.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "She curses.", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "A figure appears at the pool's edge, backlit: DESMOND \"DEZ\" ADEWALE-FRIEDMAN (18, letterman jacket, a duffel bag, a scowl).", "para": 3, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "He descends the pool ladder, rung by rung, and drops onto the floor.", "para": 3, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You're skipping rope in an empty pool.", "name": "DEZ", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You're trespassing.", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'm your ride.", "name": "DEZ", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I didn't ask for a ride.", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Mercedes did.", "name": "DEZ", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "Teddy looks across the pool.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "Mercedes shrugs, not guilty in the slightest.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Dez drove up from the state academy. He wants to race you.", "name": "MERCEDES", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Race me where?", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "In there.", "name": "DEZ", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "He nods at the pool.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "Teddy follows his gaze to the dark, cracked bowl.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's dry.", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "So we run it. Deep end to shallow. Whoever touches the wall first wins.", "name": "DEZ", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That's stupid.", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Scared?", "name": "DEZ", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Of a boy who can't swim a mile?", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I swam a mile Tuesday.", "name": "DEZ", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "In a lake. With a wetsuit.", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'm standing here, aren't I?", "name": "DEZ", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Gentlemen. Lady. Take your marks.", "name": "MERCEDES", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "Teddy tosses the rope.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "Dez drops his duffel.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "They crouch at the deep end, shoulder to shoulder.", "para": 6, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "Neither looks at the other.", "para": 6, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "The skylight light brightens a fraction.", "para": 6, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Set.", "name": "MERCEDES", "speaker": 2, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You're going to lose.", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["low"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I know.", "name": "DEZ", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": ["low"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Go.", "name": "MERCEDES", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "They launch.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "Feet slap concrete.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "Two shapes sprint up the long slope of the pool floor, breath ragged, echoes ricocheting off the tile.", "para": 7, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "For a moment, as the sun hits them, the whole bowl seems to fill with water.", "para": 7, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}]}